      "title": "ncsi: Fix the offset of hf_ncsi_cap_chcnt",
      "message": "ncsi: Fix the offset of hf_ncsi_cap_chcnt\n\n* fixes: The offset of `hf_ncsi_cap_chcnt`` should advance by one byte\nfor the next field.\n* move the `+=` operator under the `proto_tree_add_item` function call,\nmake the code more readable.\n\nSigned-off-by: Jian Zhang <zhangjian.3032@bytedance.com>\n",
